  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In Western Desert, while Feng Jiu Ge faces a year beast army drawn by Year Beast Summoning, Fang Yuan brings Enslavement After Victorious Fight into the field. Beasts that stop fleeing gather toward him under the move as the clash with Feng Jiu Ge continues.",
      "chapters": [
        1401
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_western_desert",
        "char_feng_jiu_ge",
        "move_year_beast_summoning",
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Under the move, any life form Fang Yuan defeats has a high chance of being enslaved by him. Its core is the rank seven Immortal Gu Fight that he just obtained; with wisdom path supplementary Gu, that rule path Immortal Gu shows unique value. Immortal zombie Da Li, a second generation split soul of Spectral Soul known as the Martial Duel Heavenly King, created it, combining strength path and wisdom path. Fang Yuan learned of it from Purple Mountain True Monarch’s inheritance and is only starting to use it; unlike many unfamiliar moves, he can activate it in advance and sustain it easily in battle. After some failures he succeeds, then keeps it up while multitasking Year Beast Summoning. He blocks retreating year beasts with strength path giant hands, subdues them into slaves, and stores living beasts and some corpses in his immortal aperture.",
      "chapters": [
        1402
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "origin-and-rule",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_immortal_gu",
        "char_da_li",
        "char_martial_duel_heavenly_king",
        "path_strength",
        "path_wisdom",
        "char_purple_mountain_true_monarch",
        "move_year_beast_summoning"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan later includes enslavement after victorious fight among killer moves that could be condensed and elevated into Gu worms.",
      "chapters": [
        1561
      ],
